{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40036","headline":"尚书新造花笺 · 徐夤","name":"尚书新造花笺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"浓染红桃二月花，只宜神笔纵龙蛇。\n浅澄秋水看云母，碎擘轻苔间粉霞。\n写赋好追陈后宠，题诗堪送窦滔家。\n使君即入金銮殿，夜直无非草白麻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐夤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_40036.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40036","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}